cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this notebook, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Learning by Trial and Error: Reinforcement Learning for Managers"
abstract: >-
  A companion extra to Supply Chain AI in Python, written for
  scmaiteaching.org; it is not part of the book. A Jupyter notebook that
  explains reinforcement learning to managers, without coding: a dog learning
  a maze, exploring against exploiting, reward design, and a simple rule
  against two learners. The MIT License covers the notebook's code cells
  only, not its explanatory text.
authors:
